# Internal working notes - not for the public repo. These reference this specific
# shared server's file layout, other users' accounts/projects, GPU/hardware details,
# etc. - appropriate for local reference while building this out, not for GitHub.
# Remove this section if you'd rather have these tracked/pushed after all.
PLAN.md
STAGE_*_REPORT.md
HANDOFF.md
GAZEBO_ADAPTATION.md
DEPLOYMENT_ADAPTATION.md

# CLAUDE.md - references this specific server's absolute paths (apptainer
# sandbox location, tmux session name, GPU layout) and internal debugging
# history not meant for a public repo. Regenerate locally if needed - it's
# not the project's actual source, just local Claude Code context.
CLAUDE.md
CLAUDE.local.md

